jsonkit manpage · Write or install the man pages.

USAGE
  jsonkit manpage <command> [options]

COMMANDS
  generate   Write the man pages to a folder.
  install    Install the man pages in your home folder.
  update     Bring installed man pages up to date with this version.
  uninstall  Remove the installed man pages.

GLOBAL OPTIONS
  -h, --help        Show this help.
  -V, --version     Print the version.
  -M, --manifest    Print this command's manifest as JSON.
  -e, --explain     Explain the selected command and exit.
      --[no-]color  Turn color on or off, overriding NO_COLOR.
  -v, --verbose...  Show more detail. Repeat it for more.
  -q, --quiet       Hide info and success messages.

Run jsonkit manpage <command> --help for command details.
